eft;\">125mm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Length</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">404-1531mm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Highest Temperature of liquid</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">35℃</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Application</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Building/construction work/ domestic water supply;<br/>Agricultural irrigation and small water station;<br/>Landscaping, fountain and swimming pool<br/>And so on</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Package</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Wood or Carton (with or without plastic foam)</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Power Source</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Electric</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Submersible</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Yes</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Max Head</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">365m</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2.Performance Curve</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image009.jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240948553601145.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image005(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240948277452431.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/></strong></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Control Box</p><p><img alt=\"image011(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240949105169637.jpg\"/></p><p>·Various standard plug available</p><p>·Fire proof materials</p><p>·Compact and convenient</p><p><br/></p></td><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><