n order online?</strong></p><p>A: You can buy ourproducts through Alibaba or contact with us by Emails to make an order. </p><p><strong>3. Q: Do you have an after-sale service?</strong></p><p>A: Yes, 1 year manufacturer's warranty from the purchase date for parts and labor is offered. If you have any question about the product, you can contact us freely as you want.</p><p><strong>4. Q: Do you provide samples ? is it free or extra ?</strong></p><p>A: Yes, we could offer the sample but you need to pay for the cost both freight and product.</p><p><strong><br/></strong><br/></p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: water pump impeller, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4sr-4-deep-well-submersible-pump/4-inch-diameter-submersible-pump\"><img alt=\"4 Inch Diameter Submersible Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/4-inch-diameter-submersible-pump48532389820a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4sr-4-deep-well-submersible-pump/4-inch-diameter-submersible-pump\">4 Inch Diameter Submersible Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4sr-4-deep-well-submersible-pump/electric-submersible-pump\"><img alt=\"Electric Submersible Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/electric-submersible-pump03330558400a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4sr-4-deep-well-submersible-pump/electric-submersible-pump\">Electric Submersible Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/6-submersible-pump/6-submersible-impeller-pump/agricultural-submersible-pump\"><img alt=\"Agricultural Submersible Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/agricultural-submersible-pump40593228970a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/6-submersible-pump/6-submersible-impeller-pump/agricultural-submersible-pump\">Agricultural